# Server / BFF Layer

See `docs/agents/server.md` for full conventions.

- Proxy backend via `serverFetch()` or `$fetch` to `apiBaseUrl` — never call backend from client
- Forward auth via `access-token` cookie (HTTP-only, never expose to client)
- Return `{ success: true, data: … }` or throw `createError`
- Use `createConditionalCachedHandler` with `authScoped: true` when responses vary by login state
- Log with Pino via `server/api/utils/logger.js` — no `console.log`
